Enhancement: `repair snapshots --forget` removes broken snapshots

`restic repair snapshots --forget` can now remove broken snapshot files
reported by `restic check` or by earlier error messages from restic.

For example, `restic repair snapshots --forget 1d204771` removes the
broken snapshot file with ID `1d204771`.

https://github.com/restic/restic/issues/21892
https://github.com/restic/restic/pull/21907
